Fight Club is a drama, thriller film directed by David Fincher.

3
00:14:53,571 --> 00:14:59,571
A ticking-time-bomb insomniac and a slippery soap salesman channel
primal male aggression into a shocking new form of therapy.

4
00:19:51,428 --> 00:19:57,428
Their concept catches on, with underground "fight clubs" forming in every town, until an
eccentric gets in the way and ignites an out-of-control spiral toward oblivion.

5
00:24:49,285 --> 00:24:55,285
Narrator, played by Edward Norton.

